 "applies_to": "Shinko JIR-301-M with the C5 option, plain (non-block) Modbus protocol setting; manual No.JIR32CE4.",
 "summary": "The JIR-301-M is a digital indicator with up to three alarm outputs and an optional retransmission output; it measures thermocouple, RTD, current or voltage inputs. With the C5 option it speaks Shinko protocol, Modbus ASCII or Modbus RTU on RS485. The map covers PV, alarm settings and states, input and scaling settings.",
